# Tokens created together enter together (CR 111.1, 101.4), and each is judged against the battlefield as it was before
# (CR 614.12): Devastating Onslaught for X=2 copies Giada, so two Angel tokens that are Giadas enter at once. Only the original
# Giada is an "Angel you already control" for either, and only her replacement applies (the other token is not on the
# battlefield yet): each token enters with exactly one +1/+1 counter. The legend rule (CR 704.5j) then keeps one Giada: Bot1
# keeps the second token, a 3/3 with one counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
